  "limitations": [
    "Code16 uses protected-mode execution with the 32-bit compiler stack ABI; no real-mode/VM86 or NeverC i386 target is enabled.",
    "No compiler intrinsic here promises complete original-image GPR/vector restoration. Ambient machine state and hardware own the transfer.",
    "Fault ordering, asynchronous delivery, CET, complete SMM/SGX software environments and general i386 source dispatch remain separate open domains. The final LLVM release/pin remains gated."
  ],
