    "counts_definition": "State pairs count actual executions by optimization/compiler/core profile. The 28 protected and 40 long-mode functions cover plain, fixed, dynamic and pressure frames, CPL0/CPL3 targets, six flag samples, aligned/unaligned frames and immediate cleanup. Code16 retains a 32-bit stack ABI; destination code width follows the selected descriptor. No new software CPU fault/descriptor semantics are claimed.",
